	(gr_text "FABRICATION NOTES\n \n  1. BOARD VIEW FROM PRIMARY (FRONT/TOP) SIDE. \n \n  2. ALL DIMENSIONS ARE IN MILLIMETERS UNLESS OTHERWISE NOTED.\n     BOARD DIMENSIONS: 83.0 x 37.0mm.\n     BOARD OUTLINE AND CUTOUT TOLERANCE SHALL BE +/- 0.25mm.\n \n  3. FABRICATE BOARD PER IPC-6012, TYPE 3, CLASS 2.\n     USE THE PROVIDED GERBER FILES AND NC DRILL DATA.\n     PDF FILES INCLUDED ARE FOR REFERENCE ONLY.\n \n  4. STACKUP:\n       FR-4, TG155, DESIRED FINAL THICKNESS 1.6mm (+/- 10%)\n         \n         PRIMARY   (F)      - 1 Oz. COPPER* (0.5oz base)\n         ------------------ - PREPREG 0.1mm NOMINAL\n         INNER1    (In1)    - 0.5 Oz. COPPER*\n         ------------------ - CORE 1.27mm NOMINAL\n         INNER2    (In2)    - 0.5 Oz. COPPER*\n         ------------------ - PREPREG 0.1mm NOMINAL\n         SECONDARY (B)      - 1 Oz. COPPER* (0.5oz base)\n       \n       * 0.5 Oz. COPPER DEFINED AS 17.5um NOMINAL, 15um MINIMUM FINISHED COPPER THICKNESS.\n       * 1 Oz. COPPER DEFINED AS 35um NOMINAL, 25um MINIMUM FINISHED COPPER THICKNESS.\n       * 2 Oz. COPPER DEFINED AS 70um NOMINAL, 55um MINIMUM FINISHED COPPER THICKNESS.\n       \n  5. CONTROLLED IMPEDANCE REQUIREMENTS:\n       NONE\n  \n  6. BOARD SURFACE FINISH:\n       ELECTROLESS NICKEL IMMERSION GOLD (ENIG)\n\n  7. SOLDER MASK:\n       GREEN COLOR\n       APPLY SOLDER MASK OVER BARE COPPER.\n\n  8. SILKSCREEN:\n       WHITE NON-CONDUCTIVE INK\n       SILKSCREEN IS NOT PERMITTED ON ANY EXPOSED COPPER FEATURES.\n       OVERLAP ONTO NON-COMPONENT HOLES IS ALLOWED.\n       MINIMUM SILKSCREEN TEXT HEIGHT, AS DESIGNED, IS 1.0mm.\n       MINIMUM SILKSCREEN LINE THICKNESS, AS DESIGNED, IS 0.15mm.\n\n  9. MINIMUM ANNULAR RING SHALL BE IN ACCORDANCE WITH IPC-6012 CLASS 2.\n\n  10. MINIMUM TRACE WIDTH, AS DESIGNED, IS 0.15mm.\n      MINIMUM CLEARANCE, AS DESIGNED, IS 0.15mm.\n\n  11. MINIMUM VIA DRILL, AS DESIGNED, IS 0.3mm.\n      MINIMUM VIA PAD DIAMETER, AS DESIGNED, IS 0.5mm.\n"
